WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:12.899
I touch many things.

2
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:17.966
They feel different.

3
00:00:17.967 --> 00:00:23.602
I touch the basketball.

4
00:00:23.603 --> 00:00:27.344
It feels bumpy.

5
00:00:27.345 --> 00:00:29.998
I touch the tree.

6
00:00:29.999 --> 00:00:34.294
It feels rough.

7
00:00:34.295 --> 00:00:36.945
I touch the stone.

8
00:00:36.946 --> 00:00:41.073
It feels hard.

9
00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:43.927
I touch the fishbowl.

10
00:00:43.928 --> 00:00:48.075
It feels smooth.

11
00:00:48.077 --> 00:00:51.321
I touch the water.

12
00:00:51.322 --> 00:00:55.549
It feels wet.

13
00:00:55.551 --> 00:00:58.328
I touch the towel.

14
00:00:58.329 --> 00:01:02.478
It feels dry.

15
00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:05.278
I touch the butter.

16
00:01:05.279 --> 00:01:09.917
It feels oily.

17
00:01:09.918 --> 00:01:12.477
I touch the jam.

18
00:01:12.478 --> 00:01:16.938
It feels sticky.

19
00:01:16.939 --> 00:01:20.063
I touch the pillow.

20
00:01:20.064 --> 00:01:24.481
It feels soft.

21
00:01:24.482 --> 00:01:27.446
I touch the teddy bear.

22
00:01:27.447 --> 00:01:31.443
It feels furry.

23
00:01:31.444 --> 00:01:40.161
Things feel different.
